<title>DUBAI: UAE paper says office manager in Khartoum arrested.</title>
<headline>UAE paper says office manager in Khartoum arrested.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates al-Khaleej newspaper said on Wednesday that Sudanese authorities had arrested its office manager in Khartoum.</p>
<p>It said security forces arrested Noureddine Madani on Tuesday without giving any reasons.</p>
<p>It said the Sudanese Alwan newspaper had on Saturday attacked al-Khaleej and the other UAE paper al-Bayan for printing material alleged to be opposed to Sudan's beliefs.</p>
</text>
